  "body": "## Scope\n- Move Hermes-specific adapter, verifier, certification, and bundle logic into `examples/hermes/`.\n- Remove automatic Hermes detection/innervation from generic assimilation and remove Hermes file-marker inference from product mapping.\n- Keep the historical required-check name on PRs, but skip its Hermes work unless manually dispatched; make upstream compatibility manual-only.\n- Make release evidence host-independent and restrict product CodeQL/lint/package scope to MantleOS2 rather than optional Hermes or independent Anchor/SCAN.\n- Clarify Anchor/SCAN is a stored independent project, with integration requiring a later explicit decision.\n\n## Validation\n- 195 tests passed, 3 environment-dependent skips; Ruff and public-tree audit passed.\n- Fresh wheel and sdist contain no Hermes/Anchor/SCAN paths.\n- Generic release evidence built without host checkout; optional pinned Hermes seed apply and verification passed.\n- Four canonical SCAN Markdown docs match the Drive copies exactly after PR #39.",
